# A will to sell looks for a trader who buys something carried
#
# The hawker wants to sell, and stands before the brewer, who trades here and buys crops. This body
# carries no crop, so selling to the brewer is no end for the will. The proposal stays offered to a free
# mind (cli/verb/propose_to_sell); only the will passes it by. will_sell_finds_buyer.cli is the same
# scene carrying what the brewer buys.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm hawking --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Hall" --period noon

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

expect-state will will hawking steps=none
quit
